    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ace your classes, party on the weekends, rizz up your doubles partner, and save tennis!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921530/extras/9ffd9a7ce4ec52c8ce541a72d318d0de.poster.avif?t=1755362038\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921530/extras/9ffd9a7ce4ec52c8ce541a72d318d0de.webm?t=1755362038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921530/extras/9ffd9a7ce4ec52c8ce541a72d318d0de.mp4?t=1755362038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfbe About</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a college freshman at Tensington Academy: Balancing school life, classes, dating, and TENNIS. Uncover the mysteries of the grandiose school as you work with a ball fairy named Servie, engaging in paranatural tennis battles - all while finding time for your romantic doubles partner, of course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HEROIC TENNIS BATTLES</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GIANT BOSS FIGHTS</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GAY ROMANCE</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FULL-LENGTH STORY</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DIVERSE CAST</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COLLEGE LYFE</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CUSTOMIZABLE STATS &amp; SKILLS</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EXPLORE THE SCHOOL'S DUNGEONS</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921530/extras/97fc5079437ef39f737a4489778748b3.avif?t=1755362038\" width=616 height=347 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Romanceable Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921530/extras/b9432fa33f15c2d779424978a4a272e9.avif?t=1755362038\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know the unusual students at the Academy, and go on dates during your free time. Improving your relationship with someone also improves your abilities during battle, so it's always a good idea to make friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improving your relationship with one of your classmates may lead to them inviting you to the Moonlit Court and propose to be your <strong>Doubles Partner!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921530/extras/ef51e7e2df17eb366e8a158c68d89226.avif?t=1755362038\" width=616 height=308 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planned Accessibility Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an idea from Laura Kate Dale to create a new industry standard. By listing planned accessibility features, groups of people don't have to wait until the game is released to know if they'll be able to play it. If there is an accessibility feature you'd like to request, e-mail us or post in our Discord. You can also find the list on our Accessibility Page on our Website.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FULLY BLIND ACCESSIBLE - This is something I worked on with Britt Dye at Whitethorn - we had an ambitious goal to create a new industry standard of making RPGs blind-accessible. (If a small indie can do it, so can AAA!) I plan on continuing this work with Tennis Academy, and will do my best to create an action RPG that blind players can enjoy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Text - Adjust Size, Speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graphics - Colorblind Mode, Adjust Brightness/Contrast, </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound - Adjust Master Volume, Music, Sound Effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty - Difficulty settings, Skip Matches, Story-Only Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Motor Ability - Tennis Match Settings for players with motor disabilities, Rumble On/Off, Remappable Controls</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921530/extras/b035111af650ff08b1ff4842849ec13a.avif?t=1755362038\" width=616 height=347 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content Warnings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood - Depiction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alcohol - Depiction, mention</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sexual Encounters (consensual!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cartoon Violins</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo-developed by Rawb Herb in Godot using Yarnspinner for dialogue. Assets made in Procreate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our discord community! I also frequently post on twitter, tiktok, and youtube and answer community questions!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ace your classes, party on the weekends, rizz up your doubles partner, and save tennis!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921530/extras/9ffd9a7ce4ec52c8ce541a72d318d0de.poster.avif?t=1755362038\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921530/extras/9ffd9a7ce4ec52c8ce541a72d318d0de.webm?t=1755362038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921530/extras/9ffd9a7ce4ec52c8ce541a72d318d0de.mp4?t=1755362038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfbe About</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a college freshman at Tensington Academy: Balancing school life, classes, dating, and TENNIS. Uncover the mysteries of the grandiose school as you work with a ball fairy named Servie, engaging in paranatural tennis battles - all while finding time for your romantic doubles partner, of course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HEROIC TENNIS BATTLES</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GIANT BOSS FIGHTS</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GAY ROMANCE</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FULL-LENGTH STORY</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DIVERSE CAST</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COLLEGE LYFE</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CUSTOMIZABLE STATS &amp; SKILLS</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EXPLORE THE SCHOOL'S DUNGEONS</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921530/extras/97fc5079437ef39f737a4489778748b3.avif?t=1755362038\" 