 an action RPG that blind players can enjoy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Text - Adjust Size, Speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graphics - Colorblind Mode, Adjust Brightness/Contrast, </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound - Adjust Master Volume, Music, Sound Effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty - Difficulty settings, Skip Matches, Story-Only Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Motor Ability - Tennis Match Settings for players with motor disabilities, Rumble On/Off, Remappable Controls</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921530/extras/b035111af650ff08b1ff4842849ec13a.avif?t=1755362038\" width=616 height=347 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content Warnings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood - Depiction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alcohol - Depiction, mention</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sexual Encounters (consensual!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cartoon Violins</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo-developed by Rawb Herb in Godot using Yarnspinner for dialogue. Assets made in Procreate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our discord community! I also frequently post on twitter, tiktok, and youtube and answer community questions!</p>",
